programs in fields such as engineering, natural sciences, and social sciences.\"}, {\"id\": \"s6\", \"text\": \"The Anatolian University Libraries Consortium Association (ANIKOS) is a library consortium that brings together university libraries in Turkey to share resources, expertise, and best practices.\"}, {\"id\": \"s7\", \"text\": \"The consortium was established in 2001 and currently has over 100 member libraries from universities across Turkey.\"}, {\"id\": \"s8\", \"text\": \"**Evidence of Membership**\"}, {\"id\": \"s9\", \"text\": \"According to the Turkish-German University's website, the university's library is a member of ANKOS, which provides access to a vast collection of electronic resources, including e-books, journals, and databases.\"}, {\"id\": \"s10\", \"text\": \"[1]\"}, {\"id\": \"s11\", \"text\": \"Furthermore, ANKOS's own website lists Turkish-German University as one of its member institutions, along with other prominent universities in Turkey.\"}, {\"id\": \"s12\", \"text\": \"[2]\"}, {\"id\": \"s13\", \"text\": \"In addition, a report published by the Turkish National Library and Archives (TÜBİTAK) in 2020 lists Turkish-German University as a member of ANKOS, highlighting the university's efforts to improve its library services and resources through collaboration with other institutions.\"}, {\"id\": \"s14\", \"text\": \"[3]\"}, {\"id\": \"s15\", \"text\": \"**Conclusion**\"}, {\"id\": \"s16\", \"text\": \"Based on the evidence presented above, it is clear that Turkish-German University is a member of the Anatolian University Libraries Consortium Association (ANKOS).\"}, {\"id\": \"s17\", \"text\": \"This membership provides the university's students and faculty with access to a wide range of academic resources and opportunities for collaboration with other institutions in Turkey.\"}, {\"id\": \"s18\", \"text\": \"**References**\"}, {\"id\": \"s19\", \"text\": \"[1] Turkish-German University.\"}, {\"id\": \"s20\", \"text\": \"(n.d.).\"}, {